---
title: HTP inventory requests
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant HTP
    participant fclt
    participant Cache as Machine cache
    participant Roots as Known global roots
    HTP->>fclt: inventory --global --json
    fclt->>Cache: Read snapshot and dependencies
    fclt->>Roots: Check dependency metadata
    alt Valid cache
        Cache-->>fclt: Cached inventory
    else Missing or changed
        fclt->>Roots: Scoped capability scan
        Roots-->>fclt: Inventory
        opt Writes allowed
            fclt->>Cache: Atomic snapshot write
        end
    end
    fclt-->>HTP: Stable JSON and cache metadata
